Z||000000||Philphine||01-01-2001||07:42 AM||||<BR>i've mentioned a few times i'm just doing webtv. the cheap one at that. i've been offered the plus model at a really good price. it would allow me to do pics, maybe some other stuff, i don't know.<P>but i'm wondering if i'll be able to pull up long and pic intence threads better also. pretty much any "show us your..." type threads i never see. if not i guess i'll forgo it and just wait till i can make the switch to a computer.<P>anybody had both that can tell me if it's worth it. i would just buy it just cause it's cheap but xmas and getting another fiero makes me have to be a little more money cautious right now. don't know how long he'll keep it.||||reg||1
